{"seq":3,"slug":"unions-collective-bargaining","title":"工会与集体谈判","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/labor-economics/market-frictions-institutions/unions-collective-bargaining","wordCount":3306,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"工会与集体谈判\">工会与集体谈判</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>工会（Trade Union / Labor Union）是劳动者为维护集体利益而自愿组建的组织，其核心功能是通过集体谈判（Collective Bargaining）替代个体工人与雇主之间的逐一议价。作为劳动力市场中最重要的制度力量之一，工会在 20 世纪中叶曾覆盖发达国家三分之一以上的劳动者，深刻塑造了工资结构、工作条件和劳资关系的面貌。</p>\n<p>然而，自 1980 年代以来，全球范围内工会密度持续下降——美国私营部门工会化率从 1955 年的 33% 降至 2023 年的仅 6%。这一趋势引发了一系列关键问题：工会衰落是否解释了收入不平等的加剧？在零工经济和远程办公时代，集体劳动力量是否还有存在的基础？</p>\n<p>本文将从理论模型出发，分析工会对工资、就业和效率的影响，梳理实证证据，并讨论集体谈判制度的跨国差异及其经济后果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>工会的经济分析围绕一个核心张力展开：工会通过集体议价提高会员工资（&quot;垄断面&quot;），但这种工资溢价可能以就业或利润为代价；同时工会可能通过&quot;集体发声&quot;降低流动率、改善生产率（&quot;制度面&quot;）。净福利效应取决于两种力量的相对大小以及集体谈判的层级结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[工会的集体议价权] --&gt; B[垄断面: 抬高会员工资]&#10;    A --&gt; C[制度面: 集体发声与生产率]&#10;    B --&gt; D[工会工资溢价]&#10;    B --&gt; E[潜在的就业 / 利润代价]&#10;    C --&gt; F[降低流动率 / 改善沟通]&#10;    C --&gt; G[可能促进或抑制创新]&#10;    D --&gt; H[工资压缩: 缩小技能间差距]&#10;    F --&gt; I[净效率效应取决于制度环境]&#10;    E --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[工会的集体议价权] --&gt; B[垄断面: 抬高会员工资]\n    A --&gt; C[制度面: 集体发声与生产率]\n    B --&gt; D[工会工资溢价]\n    B --&gt; E[潜在的就业 / 利润代价]\n    C --&gt; F[降低流动率 / 改善沟通]\n    C --&gt; G[可能促进或抑制创新]\n    D --&gt; H[工资压缩: 缩小技能间差距]\n    F --&gt; I[净效率效应取决于制度环境]\n    E --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><p>下表汇总工会经济学的核心概念：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>经济含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工会工资溢价</td>\n<td>会员与非会员的工资差</td>\n<td>集体议价力的直接体现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>垄断工会模型</td>\n<td>工会选择工资、企业决定雇佣</td>\n<td>工资与就业的权衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有效议价模型</td>\n<td>双方联合决定工资与就业</td>\n<td>可同时提高工资与效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部人-外部人模型</td>\n<td>在职者 vs 失业者的议价地位</td>\n<td>解释工资刚性与持续性失业</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Calmfors-Driffill 假说</td>\n<td>谈判层级与宏观绩效的非线性关系</td>\n<td>分散与集中谈判均可能优于中间层级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工会的经济理论\">工会的经济理论</h2><h3 id=\"垄断工会模型\">垄断工会模型</h3><p>最简单的工会模型将工会视为劳动力的垄断供给者，单方面设定工资 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，企业在给定工资下决定雇佣量（在需求曲线上选点）。</p>\n<p>工会目标函数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>w</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_w \\Omega(w) = (w - w_a) \\cdot L^d(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.45em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是工人的替代收入（保留工资），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^d(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是劳动需求函数。</p>\n<p>一阶条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial \\Omega}{\\partial w} = L^d(w) + (w - w_a) L^{d&#x27;}(w) = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" st